    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106699" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὑμήν</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ένος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Hymen,</i> the god of marriages, v. ll. cc.
